# 10. Example workflows for the remaining model stacks (plain JSONs, direct URL).
#     Qwen-Image 2.1: insert LoraLoaderModelOnly (lenovo_qwen21.safetensors @ 0.7)
#       after UNETLoader; KSampler 50 steps / cfg 4 / res_2s / beta
#       (res_2s needs the RES4LYF nodes, see config/nodes.txt).
#     Krea 2: fully native nodes; set lora_name -> lenovo_krea2_3000.safetensors
#       @ 0.8, unet_name -> krea2_raw_fp8_scaled.safetensors, ~52 steps / cfg 3.5-4.
#       (Turbo defaults 8 steps / cfg 1 also work with the LoRA at 1.2-2.0.)
workflow|image_qwen_image_2_1_t2i.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/main/templates/image_qwen_image_2_1_t2i.json|
workflow|image_krea2_turbo_t2i.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/main/templates/image_krea2_turbo_t2i.json|
# 11. Image-to-image / reference-image workflows (added 2026-09-24).
#     a) image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit.json — Qwen-Image 2.1 native edit.
#        Up to 10 reference images: image_1 is the edit TARGET, the rest are
#        references (mention as <img>1</img>, <img>2</img> ... in the prompt).
#        Uses the exact 2.1 base/encoder/VAE already downloaded above —
#        NO new models needed. 25 steps / euler / cfg 1.
#     b) image_qwen_image_edit_2509.json — dedicated multi-image edit model
#        (image + optional image2/image3). Needs the 2509 edit base + Qwen2.5-VL
#        7B encoder + Lightning 4-step LoRA (added below). Turbo mode is ON by
#        default: 4 steps / cfg 1. Toggle "Enable Lightning LoRA" off for the
#        20-step / cfg 2.5 quality path.
#     c) image_krea2_turbo_int8_image_style_reference.json — Krea 2 style
#        reference: generates a NEW image in the style of 1-3 reference images
#        (not an edit of them). Needs krea2_turbo_int8 base + style LoRA (added
#        below); encoder/VAE already present from 5b. prompt_enhance off default.
#     New models required for (b) and (c) only:
#       2509 edit base (fp8, ~20 GB) + Qwen2.5-VL 7B encoder (fp8, ~7 GB)
#       + Lightning LoRA (from lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning, exact URL taken
#       from the workflow template's node metadata).
diffusion|qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI::split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors|
text_encoder|qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI::split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors|
lora|Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors|hf|lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning::Qwen-Image-Edit-2509/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors|
#       Krea 2 Turbo int8 base + official style-reference LoRA (both from the
