diffusion|krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Krea-2::diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors|
lora|krea2_style_reference.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Krea-2::loras/krea2_style_reference.safetensors|
workflow|image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/main/templates/image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit.json|
workflow|image_qwen_image_edit_2509.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/main/templates/image_qwen_image_edit_2509.json|
